%%begintext align
%% The first man and second wo. set and turn single, then he turns her with his right-hand quite
%% round, the second man and first wo. do the same :| Fall back with your Partners and cross over,
%% then cross over back again, right and left quite round, and lead through the second couple. The
%% second Strain played once.
%% [DMDfD]
